  "question": {
    "text": "Two complexes <math><mo>[</mo><mtext>Cr</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mo>[</mo><mtext>Cr</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are violet and yellow coloured, respectively. The incorrect statement regarding them is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> value of A is less than that of B",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> value of A and B are calculated from the enrgies of violet and yellow light, respectively",
      "is_correct": true
